  "purpose": "Shared cross-language conformance vectors for EideticLib. Both the Swift and Rust implementations of lookup() MUST produce these outputs for the given inputs. Any divergence is a hard conformance failure.",
  "notes": [
    "expected_qid values are real Wikidata Q-IDs resolved against WikidataSubset.json v0.1.0 (assembled 2026-05-22 via the Wikidata REST API).",
    "Tests assert udc_code and wikidata_qid equality. Confidence and data_version are not part of the conformance contract.",
    "Cases with empty expected_udc AND null expected_qid are 'refuse all' cases where classifier and resolver both produce no answer.",
    "Cases with populated expected_udc and null expected_qid are 'classify only' cases where the resolver legitimately refuses below threshold."
